==Battleground==
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*30 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Dober]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Ange Lackey]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Duche]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is entirely possible to rush down THE SLOTH and defeat the base before St. Dober or Ange Lackey can spawn. Utilize [[Can Can Cat|Can Can Cat]] for the startoff, then followed up by a source of Traitless weaken like [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Ironcat]] or [[Driller Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Neo Driller Cat]], and rushers led by [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T]] and [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]]. The base can be defeated just in time before the duo crashes the party. Powerups are not needed for this to work, but Attack Up [[Cat Combo]]s are highly recommended.

